2. **Cloud/Atmospheric Attenuation**: Scenes with scene-level cloud cover > {{ plan.max_cloud_cover_percent }}% were filtered out; pixels flagged in the Scene Classification Layer (SCL) as cloud, shadow, or cirrus were masked out prior to median compositing.
